        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 70-628 Economy Priced Aluminum 3-1/2 x 15 Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size 3-1/2\" x 15\" commercial door push plate. Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, factories and stores. Made of .050\" thick aluminum. Brushed aluminum with clear anodizing finish. Packaged with mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-70-628_size.gif?v=1704354616\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 70-628 Aluminum Push Plate\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/3-1-2-x-15-aluminum-pull-plates-don-jo-7015-628\"><b>3-1/2\" x 15\" Pull Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEconomy priced for budget conscious projects, yet high quality .050\" thick solid non-rusting aluminum.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 70-628 Aluminum Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Brushed Aluminum</b> with Clear Anodizing</li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/70-628.pdf?v=1704262309\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 70-628 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> \r\n</p>",
